    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SANSEVIERIA-OU/kalliope/tarball/assets",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SANSEVIERIA-OU/kalliope/zipball/assets",
    "body": "Not a version of Kalliope: the files that go inside it, kept here so that building Kalliope never depends on anyone else's servers. Kalliope's packages already contain them; nobody needs to download them to use Kalliope.\n\n- `onnxruntime-*.tar.xz`: ONNX Runtime by Microsoft (MIT), taken from its NuGet package `Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime`, with its `LICENSE` and `ThirdPartyNotices.txt`.\n- `klein-tts-x1.5-pro-*.tar.xz`: Klein-TTS-X1.5-Pro by Klein ML (Apache-2.0), the voices Giulia and Marco, unchanged, with its licence.\n- `pocket-tts-italian-*.tar.xz`: Pocket TTS by Kyutai (https://kyutai.org), Italian model, CC BY 4.0; converted to ONNX and quantized by Kalliope (what was changed is in its `NOTICE.txt`, the licence in its `LICENSE`).\n- `test-recording-*.tar.xz`: a voice given to Kyutai's Unmute Voice Donation Project (CC0), used only by Kalliope's tests.\n\nEach name carries its version; a file stays here as long as a version of Kalliope uses it. `tools/assets.json` in the repository pins each file with its SHA-256, and `tools/fetch_assets.py` checks it after downloading. See `docs/releasing.md`.\n"
  },
